{
  "aonUrl": "/Rituals.aspx?ID=154",
  "body": [
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You create an illusory duplicate of the target creature by drawing shadowy material from the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "Netherworld",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "plane/the-netherworld"
        },
        {
          "content": " and sculpting it into a semi-solid form. The shadow double is a 4th-level creature with no special abilities. If it needs to attempt a roll or use a DC, use the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "moderate number",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "rules/understanding-statistics"
        },
        {
          "content": " for a monster, except as noted below. It doesn’t have any specific memories from the target, but it can use information about the creature gained from any of the casters to ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "Impersonate",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "action/impersonate"
        },
        {
          "content": " the target. It looks exactly like the target and has a ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "Deception",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "skill/deception"
        },
        {
          "content": " modifier to Impersonate that creature equal to the modifier of the secondary spellcaster who rolled the Deception check, with a +4 status bonus.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Though it doesn’t have any of the original’s special abilities, like a dragon’s breath, illusions allow it to appear to use those abilities; they just never seem to have an effect. For instance, against a double’s dragon’s breath, all creatures in the area seem to critically succeed at their saving throws and take no damage. Creatures can attempt to disbelieve the illusion by attempting a ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "Perception",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "rules/perception"
        },
        {
          "content": " check against the Deception DC of the secondary spellcaster who rolled the Deception check.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Critical Success",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " You create the shadow double. It has the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "minion",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/minion"
        },
        {
          "content": " trait and is under your absolute control. You gain a direct mental link with the shadow double and can spend an action to command the shadow double via this link, even at a distance.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Success",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " As a critical success, but there is no special link between you and the shadow double. You must spend an action to command it verbally or by some other means.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Failure",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The ritual fails and has no effect.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Critical Failure",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The shadow double is created, but it isn’t your minion and is ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "hostile",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "condition/hostile"
        },
        {
          "content": " to all the casters. It does everything it can to destroy them, but if it can’t immediately slay them, the shadow double tries to escape and plots their demise.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
